Cell["StructureAdaptiveEvolution", "GuideTitle",ExpressionUUID->"302e9e48-4ab1-814b-a1df-97413838703e"],

Cell["\<\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution searches over hypergraph rewriting rules for \
systems with chosen properties. Every candidate rule is evaluated by an \
exact, canonical, breadth-first exploration of its multiway system, so \
systems that verifiably halt are told apart from systems that only ran out of \
budget. Analysis tools probe termination, confluence and update-order \
behaviour, and an experiment layer makes results reproducible and \
statistically comparable.\
\>", "GuideAbstract",ExpressionUUID->"524bce9f-dd2e-1b4d-b2b5-e0a46b013080"],

